Omarchy Study & Focus Mode
A strict, distraction-free study session manager for Omarchy / Hyprland.
Provides tab-level website blocking with notifications, dedicated Permitted Websites (Whitelist)
and Restricted Websites (Blacklist) management, process-level distraction blocking,
and native Omarchy popup menus.
"""

